{
    "title": "OKX: Buy Bitcoin BTC & Crypto",
    "description": "OKX is one of the most secure and trusted cryptocurrency exchange apps in the world to trade and buy Bitcoin (BTC), Ethereum (ETH), Tether (USDT), Dogecoin (DOGE), and other cryptos. Put your mind to ease with OKX!\r\n\r\nONE-STOP CRYPTO EXCHANGE\r\n\u25cf We provide spot trading services with over 20 cryptocurrencies available, including Bitcoin (BTC), Ethereum (ETH), Shiba Inu (SHIB), and Tether USDT.\r\n\u25cf We provide secure and reliable cryptocurrency management services and support crypto USDC trading pairs for spot trading.\r\n\u25cf Buy top cryptocurrencies, including Bitcoin (BTC), Ethereum (ETH), and Tether USDT. Transactions are carried out via stringently-vetted service providers. And you can choose providers based on the quotes they offer.\r\n\u25cf See your crypto portfolio's profit and loss (PnL) performance trend over a daily, monthly or a self-selected period with our new asset analysis feature. We also provide financial, data analytics, and crypto wallet tools to allow you to manage your investment portfolios.\r\n\u25cf With our unique semi-offline multi-signature technology and our hot and cold wallets, we've taken an all-encompassing view of security to ensure the safety of your crypto assets.\r\n\r\nGET CRYPTOCURRENCY INSIGHTS AND ALERTS\r\n\u25cf Our Learn platform provides blockchain market insights and crypto trading tutorials that help you learn how to buy bitcoin and crypto, earn passive income, create professional trading strategies and stay on top of the crypto industry and markets.\r\n\u25cf Set price alerts to receive real-time notifications on your favorite cryptocurrencies. You can also view bitcoin and crypto prices and adjust your trading strategies.\r\n\r\nOKX Web3 Wallet\r\nOKX has a robust Web3 Wallet where you can view all your assets under different DeFi protocols and blockchains in one place. Enter Web3, thousands of DeFi and GameFi experiences at your fingertips, such as Aave, Uniswap, Axie Infinity, select DAOs, and many more. OKX has one of the best blockchain wallets in the crypto industry.\r\n\r\nCRYPTOCURRENCY ASSETS\r\nSome of the crypto tokens we support - Bitcoin (BTC), Ethereum (ETH), Solana (SOL), Dogecoin (DOGE), Tether (USDT), Avalanche (AVAX), Polygon (MATIC), Litecoin (LTC), Chainlink (LINK), Cosmos (ATOM), AAVE, USDC, Shiba Inu (SHIB), Tezos(XTZ), Maker (MKR), Stacks (STX).\r\n\r\nCUSTOMER SUPPORT\r\nWhether you\u2019re an experienced crypto trader or brand new to bitcoin and cryptocurrency, our Customer Support team is here to help. For assistance, email us at support@okx.com.  24/7 support is available in multiple languages.\r\n\r\nABOUT OKX\r\nOKX is an innovative cryptocurrency exchange that serves your needs for Bitcoin, Crypto & Web3.\r\n\r\nPlease be aware that products and services offered by entities within the OKX group may vary depending on the specific entity. For more information, please refer to the OKX Terms of Use and Risk & Compliance Disclosure. Additionally, certain products and services may not be available in your jurisdiction and may not be regulated or supervised by the relevant regulatory authorities.",
    "descriptionHTML": "OKX is one of the most secure and trusted cryptocurrency exchange apps in the world to trade and buy Bitcoin (BTC), Ethereum (ETH), Tether (USDT), Dogecoin (DOGE), and other cryptos. Put your mind to ease with OKX!<br><br>ONE-STOP CRYPTO EXCHANGE<br>\u25cf We provide spot trading services with over 20 cryptocurrencies available, including Bitcoin (BTC), Ethereum (ETH), Shiba Inu (SHIB), and Tether USDT.<br>\u25cf We provide secure and reliable cryptocurrency management services and support crypto USDC trading pairs for spot trading.<br>\u25cf Buy top cryptocurrencies, including Bitcoin (BTC), Ethereum (ETH), and Tether USDT. Transactions are carried out via stringently-vetted service providers. And you can choose providers based on the quotes they offer.<br>\u25cf See your crypto portfolio&#39;s profit and loss (PnL) performance trend over a daily, monthly or a self-selected period with our new asset analysis feature. We also provide financial, data analytics, and crypto wallet tools to allow you to manage your investment portfolios.<br>\u25cf With our unique semi-offline multi-signature technology and our hot and cold wallets, we&#39;ve taken an all-encompassing view of security to ensure the safety of your crypto assets.<br><br>GET CRYPTOCURRENCY INSIGHTS AND ALERTS<br>\u25cf Our Learn platform provides blockchain market insights and crypto trading tutorials that help you learn how to buy bitcoin and crypto, earn passive income, create professional trading strategies and stay on top of the crypto industry and markets.<br>\u25cf Set price alerts to receive real-time notifications on your favorite cryptocurrencies. You can also view bitcoin and crypto prices and adjust your trading strategies.<br><br>OKX Web3 Wallet<br>OKX has a robust Web3 Wallet where you can view all your assets under different DeFi protocols and blockchains in one place. Enter Web3, thousands of DeFi and GameFi experiences at your fingertips, such as Aave, Uniswap, Axie Infinity, select DAOs, and many more. OKX has one of the best blockchain wallets in the crypto industry.<br><br>CRYPTOCURRENCY ASSETS<br>Some of the crypto tokens we support - Bitcoin (BTC), Ethereum (ETH), Solana (SOL), Dogecoin (DOGE), Tether (USDT), Avalanche (AVAX), Polygon (MATIC), Litecoin (LTC), Chainlink (LINK), Cosmos (ATOM), AAVE, USDC, Shiba Inu (SHIB), Tezos(XTZ), Maker (MKR), Stacks (STX).<br><br>CUSTOMER SUPPORT<br>Whether you\u2019re an experienced crypto trader or brand new to bitcoin and cryptocurrency, our Customer Support team is here to help. For assistance, email us at support@okx.com.  24/7 support is available in multiple languages.<br><br>ABOUT OKX<br>OKX is an innovative cryptocurrency exchange that serves your needs for Bitcoin, Crypto &amp; Web3.<br><br>Please be aware that products and services offered by entities within the OKX group may vary depending on the specific entity. For more information, please refer to the OKX Terms of Use and Risk &amp; Compliance Disclosure. Additionally, certain products and services may not be available in your jurisdiction and may not be regulated or supervised by the relevant regulatory authorities.",
